    {
      "id": "beat_chapter_012",
      "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
      "summary": "试炼进入林地深处后，陆照临发现每株药草旁都插着标记木签，木签上的日期与灵气强弱并不相符。",
      "narrativeBrief": [
        {
          "text": "第二天清晨，雨停了。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 137,
            "end": 137
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "陆照临是在一阵铜铃声里醒来的。窗纸透进灰白的天光，屋檐上的水珠一颗接一颗落下，打在石阶上，声音细而密。他摊开手掌，那道淡青色的痕迹已经浅了许多，只在掌纹交会处留下一点冷意。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 139,
            "end": 139
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "昨夜被抬进门房的旅人，他没有再见到。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 141,
            "end": 141
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "守门弟子只告诉他，伤者由执事接管，身份尚未查明。至于那盏没有灯芯的引路灯，门房里也没有留下。陆照临问过两次，得到的回答都一样：宗门自有处置。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 143,
            "end": 143
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "他换上临时发下的灰色短袍，沿着石阶走向登记堂。玄霄宗比夜里看见的更大，山门之后有三重院落，屋脊覆着青瓦，瓦缝中生着细小的白花。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 145,
            "end": 145
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "登记堂悬在半山腰的石台上。门楣上挂着一块旧匾，边角被风雨磨得发亮。堂中供着三幅祖师画像，画像下方各有一盏长明灯。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 147,
            "end": 147
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "最左边那盏灯的火焰比另外两盏低，灯芯却没有烧短。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 149,
            "end": 149
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "陆照临在门口停了一下。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 151,
            "end": 151
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“新来的，进去。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 153,
            "end": 153
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "说话的是一名抱着册子的女弟子。她约莫十七八岁，眉眼清淡，袖口压着一枚银色针扣。她见陆照临盯着长明灯，顺着他的目光看去，神色没有变化，只把册子往怀里收了收。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 155,
            "end": 155
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“那盏灯一直这样？”陆照临问。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 157,
            "end": 157
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“你是来登记，还是来修灯？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 159,
            "end": 159
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“登记。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 161,
            "end": 161
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“那就别问。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 163,
            "end": 163
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "她替他指了指堂内的长桌。桌后坐着一名穿青袍的女子，发髻用木簪束起，面前摊着厚厚的名册。她没有抬头，却像已经听见了门口的对话。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 165,
            "end": 165
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“陆照临？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 167,
            "end": 167
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“是。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 169,
            "end": 169
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“北河城人，十七岁，持柳氏荐书，未修过完整功法。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 171,
            "end": 171
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "青袍女子翻开文书，语气平平。她的手指很细，指甲修剪得齐整，拇指内侧却有一层常年握笔留下的薄茧。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 173,
            "end": 173
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“我叫沈砚秋，外门执事。把手放到测灵石上。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 175,
            "end": 175
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "桌角摆着一块乳白色石头。陆照临依言伸手，石面先是毫无反应，随后浮起一缕极淡的灰光。灰光只持续了片刻，便像被什么东西擦去。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 177,
            "end": 177
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "沈砚秋看了一眼测灵石，合上名册：“杂灵根，灵息微弱，准入外门。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 179,
            "end": 179
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "她说得很快，仿佛不愿让任何人听清那句评语。旁边记录的女弟子蘸了墨，笔尖落在纸上，却迟迟没有写下最后一笔。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 181,
            "end": 181
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "沈砚秋抬眼：“昨夜是否听见钟声？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 183,
            "end": 183
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "陆照临看着她。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 185,
            "end": 185
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“听见了。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 187,
            "end": 187
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“几声？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 189,
            "end": 189
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“一声封山钟，之后还有三下。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 191,
            "end": 191
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "记录的女弟子手腕一顿。墨汁在纸上晕开一个小黑点。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 193,
            "end": 193
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "沈砚秋问：“你看见了什么？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 195,
            "end": 195
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "问题问得太自然，像是已经问过很多遍。陆照临想起门房里消失的空灯，想起白发执事那句“不要描述你没有亲眼确认的部分”，也想起自己掌心曾经出现的灰白粉末。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 197,
            "end": 197
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“我看见山门外有一个受伤的人。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 199,
            "end": 199
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“还有呢？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 201,
            "end": 201
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“他没有宗门腰牌。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 203,
            "end": 203
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“还有呢？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 205,
            "end": 205
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“他手边有一盏没有点燃的灯。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 207,
            "end": 207
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "沈砚秋的眼神终于有了细微变化。不是惊讶，而是确认。她用食指压住名册边缘，问：“你碰过那盏灯吗？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 209,
            "end": 209
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“碰过灯柄。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 211,
            "end": 211
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“我也没说要查。”顾长离把账单收回去，“只是有人把宗门的药圃当成自家仓库。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 419,
            "end": 419
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "执事没有接话，只命人将两株青露草一并送到交付台。陆照临得到五枚灵石和一瓶止血散，顾长离得到两枚灵石。她把自己的灵石推回陆照临面前。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 421,
            "end": 421
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“你受伤了。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 423,
            "end": 423
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“我有药。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-057",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 425,
            "end": 425
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“药不等于灵石。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-058",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 427,
            "end": 427
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“为什么给我？”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-059",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 429,
            "end": 429
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "顾长离看向那面塌墙：“有些账，不能只看眼前的数。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-060",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 431,
            "end": 431
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "日影西斜，试炼场的白线被拉得很长。陆照临把灵石收进袖中，掌心又传来一丝冷意。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-061",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 433,
            "end": 433
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "碎墙根下，那半片烧焦的纸不知何时被风卷了出来，落在他脚边。纸上只剩一行字：",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-062",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 435,
            "end": 435
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "“第三盏灯，送入西坡旧井。”",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-063",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 437,
            "end": 437
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "陆照临抬头看向西坡。山道尽头，一盏引路灯在白日里无声地熄灭了。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-064",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 439,
            "end": 439
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "试炼进入林地深处后，陆照临发现每株药草旁都插着标记木签，木签上的日期与灵气强弱并不相符。他没有急着采摘，而是先观察风向，确认有人在用阵法调换药草位置。",
          "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-065",
          "lineRange": {
            "start": 441,
            "end": 441
          }
        }
      ],
